Description: native MRU Window switcher for the COSMIC desktop
 COSMIC Window Switcher provides a resident per-user service and a temporary,
 keyboard-driven grid of open Windows with live thumbnails. Integration is
 inert after installation and must be explicitly enabled by each user.
 .
 This build supports Pop!_OS 24.04 COSMIC Wayland sessions on amd64 only.
